        "facts": ["In series the current is the same everywhere and resistances add.", "In parallel each branch has the supply voltage and branch currents add.", "Adding a parallel branch lowers the total resistance."],
        "misconceptions": ["Adding more resistors in parallel increases the total resistance.", "The first bulb in a series circuit gets more current than the last."] },
